      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-31T20:32:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The 10-point trigger on Rooftop Combat is only for hero damage to non-hero character cards.&nbsp; So if you focus on the limbs and let Akash punch herself, you could comfortably keep it in play indefinitely.</p>",
