      "id": 65072,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-31T21:13:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We once had Rooftop Combat come out in the first round against the Dreamer. That basically gave us a perma-buff to our damage and completely negated any other potential environmental effects (which, in Megalopolis, are often bad to the point of causing us to lose by locking us out of various actions for several rounds in a row) for the entire game, since the only way Rooftop Combat was gonna go away was if someone use environmental destruction to get rid of it. I can't remember which heroes were in the game but it doesn't really matter - we kicked the Dreamer's arse anyway :). Well, her projections, I mean. We won and she herself took no damage :).</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:42:24.461Z",
